RTMLib 0.0.15 — inference wrapper and tracking, Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/Tau-J/rtmlib
  https://github.com/Tau-J/rtmlib/blob/main/LICENSE

RTMPose — pose-estimation method by Tao Jiang et al., OpenMMLab MMPose
  Source code: Apache License 2.0, OpenMMLab contributors.
  https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmpose/tree/main/projects/rtmpose
  https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmpose/blob/main/LICENSE
  Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.07399

Detector and pose weights — RTMLib Body presets
  The locked RTMLib 0.0.15 Body uses OpenMMLab's ONNX exports of the
  YOLOX HumanArt detector and RTMPose Body7 pose model. These are
  downloaded for inference. The end-to-end geometry fixture uses
  synthetic projected joints. A separate CPU inference smoke test used
  the balanced weights on a generated blank frame. Their ONNX SHA-256
  digests were 3dea6513388889f0fff4b77bf7a26013600321b9eb9ceb0e9a400a82572f5f23
  (YOLOX-m) and 5c0a4bf67953e6d2ac43ce15e77dc9d5d354ae18430a47d2c5963a7bc5683e3c
  (RTMPose-m). For live inference the cache
  records the resolved weight filenames, source URLs and SHA-256 digests.
  Weight distribution and training-data terms require separate review.
  Preset source: https://github.com/Tau-J/rtmlib/blob/main/rtmlib/tools/solution/body.py

  balanced (default):
    https://download.openmmlab.com/mmpose/v1/projects/rtmposev1/onnx_sdk/yolox_m_8xb8-300e_humanart-c2c7a14a.zip
    https://download.openmmlab.com/mmpose/v1/projects/rtmposev1/onnx_sdk/rtmpose-m_simcc-body7_pt-body7_420e-256x192-e48f03d0_20230504.zip
  lightweight (optional):
    https://download.openmmlab.com/mmpose/v1/projects/rtmposev1/onnx_sdk/yolox_tiny_8xb8-300e_humanart-6f3252f9.zip
    https://download.openmmlab.com/mmpose/v1/projects/rtmposev1/onnx_sdk/rtmpose-s_simcc-body7_pt-body7_420e-256x192-acd4a1ef_20230504.zip
  performance (optional):
    https://download.openmmlab.com/mmpose/v1/projects/rtmposev1/onnx_sdk/yolox_x_8xb8-300e_humanart-a39d44ed.zip
    https://download.openmmlab.com/mmpose/v1/projects/rtmposev1/onnx_sdk/rtmpose-x_simcc-body7_pt-body7_700e-384x288-71d7b7e9_20230629.zip

Legacy OpenCV frontal-face cascade — see the embedded Intel licence and
  attribution in backend/haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml.

